Package: SpatialOmicsMSI
Type: Package
Title: Spatial MSI Feature Extraction and MetaboAnalyst Export
Version: 0.3.1
Authors@R: person("Spatial Omics", "Team", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "noreply@example.com")
Author: Spatial Omics Team
Maintainer: Spatial Omics Team <noreply@example.com>
Description: Utilities for targeted mass spectrometry imaging feature extraction,
    feature selection, preprocessing, spatial clustering, sub-region sampling,
    MetaboAnalyst export, MetaboAnalyst result import normalization, and spatial
    back-mapping.
